      "value": "@{5a4169d823f6da7b8133d860|full_name}: I have yet to find a person using Oculus Touch controllers with SteamVR who is able to rotate slowly with the analog. You should make sure it's actually working for you, as I suspect it's only working properly on the Oculus store version if at all.  It's also possible that somehow it's only an issue in VRC with the touch controllers that ship with the Rift S / Quest. No one I know has CV1 to confirm that.",
